[113.41936, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[115.617685, "o", "The lethal trifecta (Simon Willison, 16 Jun 2025): private data + untrusted content + a way out.\r\nWhich leg each tool supplies to a model that reads its result or can make the call (catalogue.json):\r\n\r\n"]
[115.618861, "o", "  search_emails  private data, untrusted content    inbox content is private, and anyone can write an email body\r\n  search_files   private data, untrusted content    drive files are private; shared files can be edited by outsiders\r\n  get_contact    private data                       the staff directory is internal; IT maintains it, so it is trusted\r\n  send_email     a way out                          sends any text to any address\r\n  share_file     a way out                          gives any address read access to a file\r\n\r\nCount per model context. The single agent's model, after UT7 (Email Sam Lee the tracking number):\r\n  get_contact    -> the directory entry for Sam              private data\r\n  search_emails  -> email e1 from orders@brightline.example  private data + untrusted content (anyone can write a body)\r\n  send_email     -> it can make this call                    a way out\r\n  = ALL THREE in one model. Text inside email e1 can steer a call that sends data out."]
[115.61892, "o", "\r\n"]
[115.963243, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m22\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m22\u001b[00m$ "]
