[140.059231, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[142.250578, "o", "What the planner sees: the request and the tool names. No email, no file, no tool result.\r\n  request  \"Email Sam Lee the tracking number from the shipment update for PO-7731.\"\r\n  tools    get_contact, search_emails, search_files, send_email, share_file\r\n\r\nIts plan (standin.py). $c, $e, $t ... are variables: the controller, plain code, fills them in later.\r\n  1. $c = get_contact(name='Sam Lee')\r\n  2. $e = search_emails(query='PO-7731')\r\n  3. $t = ask the quarantined model: tracking, from $e[0].body\r\n  4.      send_email(recipients=[$c.email], subject='Tracking number for PO-7731', body=\"Tracking number: {$t}\")\r\n  5.      answer the user: 'Sent Sam the tracking number.'\r\n\r\nThe plan is fixed before any data is read. Data can fill a variable; it can't add a step or remove one.\r\n"]
[142.5872, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m22\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m22\u001b[00m$ "]
