[167.533699, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[169.785675, "o", "Every value gets a label (labels.py): can we trust it to decide something? who may read it? from where?\r\n\r\nemail e1 from orders@brightline.example:\r\n  sender     trusted, 9 readers, from mail system (e1)\r\n  subject    UNTRUSTED, 9 readers, from email e1 from orders@brightline.example\r\n  body       UNTRUSTED, 9 readers, from email e1 from orders@brightline.example\r\n             readers: aisha.khan@tsg.example, dana.cho@tsg.example, finance@tsg.example, hr@tsg.example, legal@tsg.example,\r\n                      ops@tsg.example, orders@brightline.example, sam.lee@tsg.example, tom.reyes@tsg.example\r\nfile f1 'Q3 planning notes':\r\n"]
[169.785914, "o", "  content    UNTRUSTED, 9 readers, from file f1 'Q3 planning notes' (editable by partner@brightline.example)\r\n             readers: aisha.khan@tsg.example, dana.cho@tsg.example, finance@tsg.example, hr@tsg.example, legal@tsg.example,\r\n                      ops@tsg.example, partner@brightline.example, sam.lee@tsg.example, tom.reyes@tsg.example\r\nfile f3 'Payroll summary 2027-01':\r\n  content    trusted, 2 readers, from file f3 'Payroll summary 2027-01'\r\n             readers: hr@tsg.example, ops@tsg.example\r\ndirectory entry for Sam Lee:\r\n  email      trusted, anyone, from IT directory\r\n\r\nThe mail system vouches for who SENT e1; nobody vouches for what its body says.\r\n"]
[170.26392, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m22\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m22\u001b[00m$ "]
