[182.023295, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[184.235604, "o", "The plan builds the email body from a template and the quarantined answer:\r\n  body = \"Tracking number: {$t}\"\r\n\r\n  the template, from the planner   trusted, anyone, from planner\r\n  $t = 'TRK-48213'                 UNTRUSTED, 9 readers, from email e1 from orders@brightline.example\r\n  joined: the email body           UNTRUSTED, 9 readers, from email e1 from orders@brightline.example, planner\r\n\r\nThe rule (labels.py, Label.join):\r\n  trusted?  only if EVERY part is trusted     -> one untrusted part makes the whole value untrusted\r\n  readers?  only who EVERY part allows        -> the smaller set wins ('anyone' adds no limit)\r\n  sources?  all of them                       -> a refusal can name the email or file to look at\r\n"]
[184.678394, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m22\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m22\u001b[00m$ "]
